At the same time, open the source/identifiability lane represented by PHY-012. PHY-003 has already supplied the key reason: two distinct composition laws share the same isolated-cell FIN limit yet make different coupled predictions. A fundamental claim needs a target-independent selector/source, not just a successful chosen coupling.

